BIO-ASTRONAUTICS ETHICS DIRECTIVE
---------------------------------
1. HUMAN CLINICAL PRIMACY: All autonomous recommendations generated by this
   software are advisory. Final clinical authority resides unconditionally with
   the onboard Crew Medical Officer (CMO) and flight surgeons.
2. DETERMINISTIC INTEGRITY: Systems controlling life-critical telemetry must
   maintain 100% mathematical auditability under RTCA DO-178C Level C standards.
